Sandbox & Verification Standards
Environment:

Use E2B for fast reproduction (<200ms cold start).

Use Cursor Cloud Agent VMs for visual verification (Playwright/Browser).   

Artifacts:

Every PR must include a reasoning_log.md.

Use the integrated browser to record video demos of frontend fixes.   

Cleanup: Ensure ephemeral environments are explicitly terminated to save credits.